# Arktwend side quest: the Stormwend arena (A_IV_Arena). The doorman Joroka greets the player at the gate and asks
# 800 coins to enter ("cost to enter" 1: 2). The trainer Hawk takes them on as a gladiator for 900 ("Gladiator" 1: 3),
# sends them for a sword (4), then to the practice ground: two wolves at the marker (5, then 6 once both are dead),
# two boars (7, Joroka set on the player), Joroka himself (8, ARENJorokaScript, resurrected), a rank (9), and the
# first fight before a crowd against Hera (10, Arenavar 1; 11, ARENHeraScript), paid 2500 and ranked again (12).
# Position stands in for the walks, the AddItem of gold for money the player earned, the console kills for the fights.
# Ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05: 052F77C5 and 05AA4D7A the wolves, 05368256 and 053378EA the boars,
# 057EB804 Joroka, 05E5721C Hera.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_storm_markus_reward --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case arena_enter
run
player->AddItem Gold_001 1700
player->Position 3000 52357 483 90
until 900 "ARENJoroka".State == 1
wait 30
ask cost to enter
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 2
end

case arena_join
run
player->Position 3900 51543 433 90
until 600 "ARENHawk"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk ARENHawk
ask Gladiator
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 3
bye
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 4
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 5
end

case arena_wolves
run
player->Position 3588 52100 458 0
wait 120
console 052F77C5.kill
console 05AA4D7A.kill
until 300 GetDeadCount ARENWolf02 >= 1
run
player->Position 3900 51543 433 90
wait 60
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 6
end

case arena_boars
run
player->Position 3588 52100 458 0
wait 120
console 05368256.kill
console 053378EA.kill
until 300 GetDeadCount ARENWildschwein02 >= 1
run
player->Position 3900 51543 433 90
wait 60
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 7
end

case arena_joroka
run
wait 60
console 057EB804.kill
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 8
run
player->Position 3900 51543 433 90
wait 60
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 9
bye
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 10
bye
end

case arena_hera
run
wait 120
console 05E5721C.kill
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 11
run
player->Position 3900 51543 433 90
wait 60
talk ARENHawk
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Arena == 12
bye
end
